{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "Maps DoD conformance behaviors to TCK case IDs. 'gated' entries are behaviors whose scenarios cannot be authored yet because they depend on the CAP-PRODUCTION dispatch-identity/attempt/replay model, which is not yet on any ref. They are listed, not omitted, so the gap is explicit.",
  "behaviors": [
